+# Corpus fetch: rate limit and hosts
+
+## Host
+
+Files were located via GitHub code search (grep.app) and fetched raw from
+`raw.githubusercontent.com` (see `manifest.tsv` header). No other CDN or
+mirror host is recorded anywhere in this repository for this fetch.
+
+## Rate limit
+
+Not found. Nothing in this repository states a per-domain visit count, a
+window length, or a post-breach cooldown for the corpus fetch. `GATE1.md`
+notes only that "fetching is rate-limited" and that the corpus was
+completed incrementally (115 of 323 files at the gate measurement, 322 of
+323 the next day) — no numeric limit is recorded alongside that note.
+
+Not inventing values here per instructions. If these numbers exist, they
+are outside this repository checkout.
